Title: Diagnosis
Details: The test `testClassInstantiationWithParameterBeingNullThrowsNullPointerExceptionThree` constructs a `ChecksumCalculatingInputStream` instance by passing a valid `Checksum` object (`CRC32()`) and a `null` `InputStream`. It expects a `NullPointerException` to be thrown.

